{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Oriontis, ruling is not just about building cities\u2014it is about power. Trade, faith, and politics are in your hands.</i></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583290/extras/748ec3d32de749c8117c83bc0e5113be.avif?t=1755802745\" width=1560 height=423 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build thriving cities: Start on floating islands and expand modest homes into prosperous city districts.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Deep management: Master complex production chains and adapt to resources that shift with each biome.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meaningful choices: Side with Sanctum or Serenity, shape your faith, alliances, and diplomacy, and decide the fate of your people.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Narrative campaigns: Play through three full campaigns in a declining kingdom, climbing the hierarchy as each mission tests your leadership.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fleets and naval warfare: Build shipyards and warships, defend your city against corsairs and even meteor storms.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Society and politics: Oriontis is not only about raising buildings, but about governing a society where every decision carries weight.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583290/extras/904ab24570ca760167f08018dd681fe1.avif?t=1755802745\" width=1560 height=593 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583290?t=1755802745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583290/6d0cc0c0b717b9c05439751e1ad118771321cc9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755802745","capsule_image":"htt